@startuml
[*] --> StartupCheck
StartupCheck --> Ready : everything is fine
StartupCheck --> Stop : problem during startup
Ready --> Reset : user reset
Ready --> Activate : user activate
Ready --> Deactivate : user deactivate
Activate --> Monitoring : start monitoring
Monitoring --> Alarm : sensor triggered
Monitoring --> Monitoring : false alarm or time ends
Alarm --> Monitoring : false alarm or time ends
Monitoring --> Stop : user enters password
Stop --> [*]
@enduml
